{
  "name": "lab",
  "about": "The launcher lab (android/homecore's wasmJsMain): every version by state by screen, on the dark wallpaper. Each link is the lab's URL hash (#version/state/screen/wallpaper), so it opens the same screen by hand. Serve it with android/web-dev.sh. A new version or state adds its rows here; android/homecore/STATES.md lists the states.",
